  eventTitle: Bottom of the Well
  description: At the bottom of the well lies a subterranean spring shimmering with
    centuries of accumulated coinage, though toxic fumes fill the hollow cavern.
  choices:
  - title: '[Greedy Grab] Shovel as much gold as possible'
    description: Take 14 Damage from choking fumes, haul out 85 Gold.
    effects:
